# Engine entries (`engine/model-kernels/kernels`) through the public API (design A9 §2.9.1,
# Tier 0; lines owned by A9). Every exported engine entry that is not also a std entry has
# at least one line. Shapes are small but non-degenerate; arguments follow parameter order
# and dimensions are inferred from shapes. Generic elements bind dense float representations
# (L11); `copy_rows` also moves an integer plane, which its slice store copies bit for bit.

